WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:03.550
Every bank and credit union publishes its fees.

00:03.890 --> 00:06.700
Almost none can see where they actually stand.

00:07.240 --> 00:10.000
Fee Insight manages the Bank Fee Index.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.900
Over forty-one thousand published fees, from more than twenty-six hundred banks and credit unions, and growing.

00:17.330 --> 00:20.820
Every fee is checked against the institution's own schedule.

00:21.660 --> 00:24.700
But no two fee schedules read alike.

00:24.700 --> 00:28.920
We count more than thirteen hundred names for one fee: non-sufficient funds.

00:29.310 --> 00:34.720
Hamilton, our intelligence layer, turns all of it into one clear, comparable picture.

00:35.200 --> 00:37.500
Benchmarking your fees against your market,

00:38.600 --> 00:39.600
your peers,

00:40.400 --> 00:41.350
your state,

00:42.200 --> 00:43.450
your Fed district,

00:44.000 --> 00:45.300
and the nation.

00:47.200 --> 00:49.300
Rich detail for your team.

00:49.310 --> 00:52.150
Consumer-friendly insight for your customers.

00:52.180 --> 00:54.850
